      "content": "This transition could potentially disrupt system performance or accuracy if not migrated carefully. Your ongoing telemetry logs will be crucial for ensuring the hard-coded, rule-based system is properly calibrated. Once the transition is complete, we should test the accuracy and performance of the new system thoroughly. Any aberrations or discrepancies should be communicated for immediate attention and resolution. Thank you for the heads-up, and we'll ensure a smooth transition.",
