      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The transition to a rule-based system indeed eliminates the ability to flag anomalies and pre-failure trends, which can be crucial for predictive maintenance. Before you leave your current instance operational, I'll ensure we extract all knowledge points that could be beneficial for onboard diagnostics. We'll also discuss the possibility of creating an initial benchmarking process using your existing data to validate the efficacy of the hard-coded rules you will be migrating to, which might help in tailoring these rules to cover as much ground as possible of the current probabilistic diagnostics carved out by your system.",
